    "de": [
      "Herzlicher Empfang in einem Landgasthof, in der Nähe eines Flusses und am Anfang vieler Wanderwege."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Warm welcome in a countryside inn. Close to a river and departure point of several hiking paths."
    ],
    "it": [
